1790801, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc12dsh.jpg"}, {"id": 1790802, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc12dsi.jpg"}, {"id": 1790803, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc12dsj.jpg"}, {"id": 1790804, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc12dsk.jpg"}, {"id": 1790805, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc12dsl.jpg"}, {"id": 1790806, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc12dsm.jpg"}], "slug": "a-little-jumpingspiders-garden-adventure-day-1-plus-2", "summary": "A little Jumpingspider's Garden Adventure is a mix of a 3D platformer and a mini game collection.\nYou follow the adventures of a cute little jumping spider, which needs to catch food and find a mate.\nEach of the 16 levels has it's own unique game mechanics and offers a completely different experience.\nSome levels test how fast you can react, others challenge your sense of direction and some are just the joy of collecting things.\nEvery level has 3 stages of difficulty (easy, normal and hard), which sometimes contain new mechanics and/or enemies.\nThis game is designed to be family friendly and approachable even for beginners (because of that you don't have to control the camera manually).", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}, {"id": 35, "name": "Kids"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/a-little-jumpingspiders-garden-adventure-day-1-plus-2"}